div.p:
To this end they have appointed their respective plenipotentiaries, to wit: 

His excellency the President of the republic of Salvador, Dr. Rafael
                            Zaldivar, envoy extraordinary and minister plenipotentiary;

His Majesty the King of Prussia, his minister of state, Martin
                            Frederick Rodolphus Delbruck, president of the chancery of the North
                            German Confederation;
